1
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,870
On the morning of the explosion,

2
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,260
I saw Qi Mo outside the valve pit.

3
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:24,600
But he seemed completely different

4
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,280
from his usual self that day.

5
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:28,050
Designers don't usually

6
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:30,060
go to emergency repair sites.

7
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:31,230
I'm not sure

8
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:32,670
whether Qi Mo had anything to do

9
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:33,800
with the explosion.

10
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,970
Just as things seemed to be looking up,

11
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,670
I was pulled back

12
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,520
into the abyss of the truth.

13
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,440
Qi Mo!

14
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:23,310
Qi Mo.

15
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:28,090
Is it really you?

16
00:02:55,520 --> 00:03:00,370
[Light the Dark]

17
00:03:01,270 --> 00:03:03,940
[Episode 8]

18
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:16,280
Xiaoyun.

19
00:03:17,890 --> 00:03:18,700
Xiaoyun.

20
00:03:21,310 --> 00:03:22,680
You've been lying all day.

21
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,079
Get up and eat something.

22
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,660
I made all your favorites.

23
00:03:27,660 --> 00:03:28,660
Come on, get up.

24
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:32,320
Just try a bite, okay?

25
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:33,829
Come on, come on, come on.

26
00:03:35,430 --> 00:03:36,630
Easy, easy, easy.

27
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,480
What's wrong?

28
00:03:50,870 --> 00:03:51,680
What's wrong?

29
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,430
What's wrong, Xiaoyun?

30
00:03:53,430 --> 00:03:54,240
Xiaoyun.

31
00:03:54,260 --> 00:03:55,860
What's wrong? What's wrong?

32
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,780
Are you okay, Xiaoyun?

33
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,980
Qi Mo.

34
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,290
Qi Mo.

35
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,700
What's going on?

36
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,420
Why is there so much blood?

37
00:04:07,670 --> 00:04:08,460
Call an ambulance.

38
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:09,080
Okay, okay, okay.

39
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,610
-Call an ambulance.
-Okay.

40
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:16,290
Hello, is this the ambulance service?

41
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:18,029
I have a pregnant woman here.

42
00:04:18,269 --> 00:04:19,660
She's bleeding a lot.

43
00:04:20,170 --> 00:04:21,180
Yes.

44
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:25,170
It's 730 Huagong Road,

45
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:26,260
Room 203.

46
00:04:26,310 --> 00:04:27,580
Hurry up, hurry up.

47
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:28,310
Yes, yes, yes.

48
00:04:28,310 --> 00:04:29,720
Xiaoyun, are you okay? Xiaoyun.

49
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,620
Xiaoyun.

50
00:04:40,310 --> 00:04:41,990
I know you've been helping me.

51
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:46,490
Are you still going to kill yourself?

52
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:48,360
Do you really think

53
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,200
I want to kill myself?

54
00:04:51,630 --> 00:04:53,450
This is the only way

55
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,270
I can see Ying.

56
00:05:01,070 --> 00:05:02,300
You're good.

57
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,200
You even fooled me.

58
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,330
I know

59
00:05:12,750 --> 00:05:13,750
you've been investigating

60
00:05:13,750 --> 00:05:15,270
whether your parents' death

61
00:05:15,270 --> 00:05:16,550
was an accident.

62
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,550
I don't know whether your father's death

63
00:05:18,550 --> 00:05:19,480
was an accident.

64
00:05:19,950 --> 00:05:21,030
But I have my doubts

65
00:05:21,050 --> 00:05:22,580
about your mother's death.

66
00:05:24,270 --> 00:05:25,570
I've asked Wan Yang.

67
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,430
He warned me right then,

68
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,520
saying I asked too many questions,

69
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,800
and refused to give me any answers.

70
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,750
So today,

71
00:05:30,780 --> 00:05:31,830
I must tell you,

72
00:05:32,110 --> 00:05:32,920
I

73
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,980
am definitely not an accomplice

74
00:05:34,980 --> 00:05:37,020
in your parents' death.

75
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:43,630
The only thing I'll admit to

76
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:45,310
is being Wan Yang's accomplice.

77
00:05:45,310 --> 00:05:47,230
I helped him raise money

78
00:05:47,270 --> 00:05:48,800
and collect payments.

79
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:53,000
Now, Wan Yang is dead.

80
00:05:53,790 --> 00:05:54,800
My job is gone.

81
00:05:55,630 --> 00:05:56,760
And I went to prison.

82
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:57,830
So,

83
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,560
I'm not pretending anymore.

84
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,960
What's there to pretend?

85
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,440
So you want to

86
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,890
turn over a new leaf?

87
00:06:05,050 --> 00:06:07,040
I don't know if I can.

88
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:09,000
I can't be a bad guy anymore.

89
00:06:09,390 --> 00:06:11,050
It just depends on whether God

90
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,860
gives me this chance.

91
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,430
God is giving you a chance.

92
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,890
Teach me how to work out.

93
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:19,520
Isn't this

94
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,850
the chance God gave you?

95
00:06:24,070 --> 00:06:25,510
Get out of here.

96
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:26,160
I teach you?

97
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,420
What chance?

98
00:06:34,650 --> 00:06:36,940
[Reform Through Labor, Rebuild Yourself]

99
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,710
Over the past few years,
our company has successfully

100
00:06:39,710 --> 00:06:41,640
overcome its business difficulties

101
00:06:39,770 --> 00:06:42,990
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution
Co., Ltd.]

102
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,659
and stabilized operations

103
00:06:43,020 --> 00:06:44,670
[Employee Appreciation Meeting]

104
00:06:43,750 --> 00:06:44,920
amid the state-owned enterprise reform.

105
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:45,600
Going forward,

106
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:48,600
we'll continue to expand
and strengthen the company.

107
00:06:49,390 --> 00:06:51,450
Throughout this challenging

108
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,630
reform process,

109
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,110
Ms. Peng Xiaoyun

110
00:06:54,190 --> 00:06:56,830
has made
outstanding contributions to our company,

111
00:06:56,830 --> 00:06:59,240
particularly in
revamping the financial system

112
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:02,360
and upgrading the information systems.

113
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:11,580
Congratulations, Ms. Peng Xiaoyun.

114
00:07:11,980 --> 00:07:15,870
[Certificate of Honor]

115
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:27,120
[Three years later]

116
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,720
Right face.

117
00:07:31,950 --> 00:07:32,990
At ease.

118
00:07:33,270 --> 00:07:34,220
Attention.

119
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:44,860
[Certificate of Release]

120
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:50,420
[Register of Personal Belongings
Permitted Upon Release]

121
00:07:50,450 --> 00:07:52,200
[I have received all the items listed above
and taken them with me upon release.]

122
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:10,640
[Wugang Prison, Jiangnan Province]

123
00:08:05,950 --> 00:08:07,720
Brother, you're out.

124
00:08:07,910 --> 00:08:09,240
You look thinner.

125
00:08:09,750 --> 00:08:10,720
Officer,

126
00:08:10,750 --> 00:08:12,560
when will Chen Shan be released?

127
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,720
Chen Shan was released early this morning.

128
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,780
He's already left.

129
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,720
He left at 8:00 AM.

130
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:21,510
He specifically requested
an early-morning release.

131
00:08:21,510 --> 00:08:22,310
Thank you.

132
00:08:22,780 --> 00:08:28,070
[Wugang Prison, Jiangnan Province]

133
00:08:36,730 --> 00:08:38,130
Still can't get through?

134
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,120
Yes.

135
00:08:40,510 --> 00:08:41,200
He...

136
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,440
We came all this way

137
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,600
for nothing.

138
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,360
He should have known

139
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,960
we were coming to pick him up.

140
00:08:48,810 --> 00:08:50,470
Let's go home and check first.

141
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,750
Still can't get through.

142
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:55,150
Still can't get through.

143
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,550
Is Shan inside?

144
00:09:30,550 --> 00:09:31,680
He hasn't come back.

145
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:34,960
Hello.

146
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:37,030
The number you dialed is powered off.

147
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:38,630
His phone is off.

148
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,270
Where else could he go?

149
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,660
I've asked people

150
00:09:51,910 --> 00:09:53,340
at the county hotels,

151
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:54,880
docks, and bus stations

152
00:09:55,270 --> 00:09:56,790
to keep an eye out for Chen Shan

153
00:09:56,790 --> 00:10:00,070
and see if they spot him.

154
00:10:01,530 --> 00:10:02,730
It's been three days.

155
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,150
There's no news at all.

156
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,270
Yes.

157
00:10:10,150 --> 00:10:11,270
But I don't think

158
00:10:11,550 --> 00:10:13,060
you should worry too much.

159
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:15,160
Maybe he just wants to spend

160
00:10:15,270 --> 00:10:16,330
some time out there

161
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:19,480
and get used to life outside prison.

162
00:10:22,550 --> 00:10:23,360
Look.

163
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,850
I told you not to work.

164
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:26,360
That's enough. Leave it, leave it.

165
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,240
I'll do the housework.

166
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:27,960
You go out

167
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,420
-and have a rest.
-It's OK.

168
00:10:32,150 --> 00:10:33,490
I... I'll go. I'll go.

169
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:34,750
Just wait here.

170
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,360
Who is it?

171
00:10:42,810 --> 00:10:43,720
Shan.

172
00:10:45,260 --> 00:10:47,190
W-Where have you been?

173
00:10:47,210 --> 00:10:48,710
Xiaoyun has been looking
for you for days.

174
00:10:48,710 --> 00:10:49,710
Where did you go?

175
00:10:49,730 --> 00:10:50,570
Come in, come in.

176
00:10:50,570 --> 00:10:51,610
Xiaoyun, look.

177
00:11:11,030 --> 00:11:11,840
Ying.

178
00:11:16,510 --> 00:11:17,480
You've grown up.

179
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,120
You look thinner.

180
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:23,720
No.

181
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:26,790
I...

182
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:30,100
bought something for the kid.

183
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:33,480
They must be almost two, right?

184
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,000
Shan,

185
00:11:36,030 --> 00:11:37,170
come, give it to me.

186
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,180
That child...

187
00:11:40,910 --> 00:11:42,040
we couldn't keep it.

188
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,580
She had a miscarriage.

189
00:11:45,910 --> 00:11:46,740
Alright, alright.

190
00:11:46,740 --> 00:11:47,670
Today,

191
00:11:47,750 --> 00:11:48,840
let's not talk about this.

192
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,840
It's good that you're back.

193
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:50,790
It's good that you're back.

194
00:11:50,790 --> 00:11:51,480
How about this?

195
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,390
Let's not eat at home.

196
00:11:52,390 --> 00:11:53,390
Let's go out to eat

197
00:11:53,390 --> 00:11:55,400
to welcome you back, okay?

198
00:11:57,630 --> 00:11:59,160
No need to go to the trouble.

199
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,600
Let's just eat at home today.

200
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:04,000
Okay, we'll eat at home.

201
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:04,320
Okay.

202
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,650
I'll cook for you.

203
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,080
Shan,

204
00:12:09,150 --> 00:12:11,300
let me show you my cooking skills.

205
00:12:15,630 --> 00:12:16,570
Come, Shan.

206
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:17,940
Come on, taste it and see

207
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:19,140
if I'm getting rusty.

208
00:12:19,230 --> 00:12:20,980
Your favorite tomato and scrambled eggs.

209
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:22,100
Come on.

210
00:12:23,030 --> 00:12:23,670
Try it.

211
00:12:24,670 --> 00:12:25,890
Are the noodles ready?

212
00:12:25,890 --> 00:12:26,550
Yes, yes, yes.

213
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:27,240
Come on.

214
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,030
Come on.

215
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:31,340
Come on. Dumplings for departure;
noodles for arrival.

216
00:12:31,370 --> 00:12:32,320
Taste Mo's cooking.

217
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,180
It's very good.

218
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:34,240
Today

219
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,360
is a good day

220
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:36,670
for the whole family to be together.

221
00:12:36,670 --> 00:12:37,440
Come on.

222
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,270
Let's

223
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,550
celebrate properly.

224
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:40,240
Come on.

225
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,910
Let's toast to Chen Shan's

226
00:12:43,620 --> 00:12:44,720
fresh start.

227
00:12:44,750 --> 00:12:45,210
Come on.

228
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:45,840
Come on.

229
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:00,270
Mr. Qi.

230
00:13:01,390 --> 00:13:03,190
I should call you Manager Qi now.

231
00:13:04,870 --> 00:13:06,150
What Manager Qi?

232
00:13:06,270 --> 00:13:07,750
You should call me
your brother-in-law now.

233
00:13:07,750 --> 00:13:09,120
But now you're calling me
Mr. Qi or Manager Qi?

234
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,030
Look at him.

235
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,510
Manager Qi.

236
00:13:13,030 --> 00:13:14,550
Ma Yiming told me

237
00:13:16,070 --> 00:13:18,870
that on the day of the explosion
at the construction site,

238
00:13:18,870 --> 00:13:20,670
he saw you outside the valve pit.

239
00:13:27,390 --> 00:13:28,850
What were you doing there?

240
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:30,800
Shan.

241
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:33,510
Have you been in prison

242
00:13:33,510 --> 00:13:34,700
so long you've lost your mind?

243
00:13:34,700 --> 00:13:36,510
What nonsense are you talking about?

244
00:13:36,510 --> 00:13:38,270
What were you doing there?

245
00:13:41,390 --> 00:13:42,200
Did that explosion

246
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,800
have anything to do with you?

247
00:13:44,030 --> 00:13:44,930
Did my dad's death

248
00:13:44,930 --> 00:13:46,530
have anything to do with you?

249
00:13:50,030 --> 00:13:51,830
I've never been to the valve pit.

250
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:53,690
At that time, I was living

251
00:13:53,690 --> 00:13:54,890
in Master's office.

252
00:13:55,550 --> 00:13:56,790
I was working on my thesis

253
00:13:56,790 --> 00:13:57,750
in the office after work.

254
00:13:57,750 --> 00:13:58,610
I didn't even

255
00:13:58,640 --> 00:13:59,230
go out of the plant gate.

256
00:13:59,230 --> 00:14:00,370
How could I have been to the valve pit,

257
00:14:00,370 --> 00:14:00,970
Chen Shan?

258
00:14:00,990 --> 00:14:03,590
You know best
whether you've been there or not.

259
00:14:03,790 --> 00:14:05,480
Why did you kill my dad?

260
00:14:05,750 --> 00:14:07,810
What was your motive for killing him?

261
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,510
Shan.

262
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:16,450
What exactly are you trying to say?

263
00:14:17,030 --> 00:14:18,820
You can't just say things like this.

264
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:20,240
Ma Yiming

265
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:22,240
told me this himself before he died.

266
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,960
You said you've never been there.

267
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:25,870
You mean he was lying.

268
00:14:27,030 --> 00:14:28,540
So I'm the one lying?

269
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,100
Chen Shan.

270
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:32,610
I don't care

271
00:14:32,610 --> 00:14:33,900
where you've been these past few days.

272
00:14:33,900 --> 00:14:34,780
You can't just take

273
00:14:34,780 --> 00:14:35,510
someone else's word for it

274
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:36,420
and pin a serious accusation

275
00:14:36,420 --> 00:14:37,470
on me.

276
00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:38,910
We can't joke about this.

277
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:40,270
Ying,

278
00:14:40,540 --> 00:14:41,870
on your wedding day,

279
00:14:41,870 --> 00:14:43,250
I was riding my bike with Ma Yiming.

280
00:14:43,250 --> 00:14:43,990
I wanted to tell you

281
00:14:43,990 --> 00:14:44,820
about this,

282
00:14:44,820 --> 00:14:45,780
but we got into an accident,

283
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:46,840
and Ma Yiming died.

284
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:48,820
Later, when I saw you in prison,

285
00:14:48,820 --> 00:14:50,490
I still wanted to tell you.

286
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:52,470
But I saw you were pregnant.

287
00:14:52,470 --> 00:14:54,070
You were carrying his child.

288
00:14:56,580 --> 00:14:57,620
But today,

289
00:14:57,650 --> 00:14:58,630
I need an answer.

290
00:14:59,420 --> 00:15:00,350
Tell me,

291
00:15:01,230 --> 00:15:02,750
why did you kill my dad?

292
00:15:07,060 --> 00:15:07,990
Answer me.

293
00:15:10,420 --> 00:15:12,020
What am I supposed to answer?

294
00:15:14,110 --> 00:15:15,060
Who is Chen Fu?

295
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:18,920
He is my master's husband,

296
00:15:19,180 --> 00:15:20,030
your father.

297
00:15:20,060 --> 00:15:21,300
I call him dad now!

298
00:15:24,630 --> 00:15:25,180
Okay.

299
00:15:25,990 --> 00:15:27,150
Let's put others

300
00:15:27,150 --> 00:15:27,630
aside.

301
00:15:27,630 --> 00:15:29,490
Let's just talk about Mr. Chen Fu.

302
00:15:29,700 --> 00:15:31,560
He was the only person at the plant

303
00:15:32,940 --> 00:15:35,270
who believed I had talent.

304
00:15:37,300 --> 00:15:38,270
Whenever I was mistreated

305
00:15:38,270 --> 00:15:38,940
or bullied

306
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:40,270
at the factory,

307
00:15:40,350 --> 00:15:41,940
he'd secretly take me out for a drink

308
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:43,270
to cheer me up.

309
00:15:44,300 --> 00:15:45,470
How could I harm him?

310
00:15:46,900 --> 00:15:48,060
These Chen Fu noodles you're eating?

311
00:15:48,060 --> 00:15:49,060
Your dad taught me

312
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,460
how to make them!

313
00:15:52,870 --> 00:15:53,660
Chen Shan,

314
00:15:54,470 --> 00:15:56,180
I think you should know

315
00:15:58,420 --> 00:16:01,020
that when something happened
to your parents,

316
00:16:03,230 --> 00:16:04,190
I put my own future

317
00:16:04,190 --> 00:16:05,690
on the line, too.

318
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:08,830
Your parents died,

319
00:16:09,390 --> 00:16:11,590
and it hurt me just
as much as it hurt you!

320
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:27,970
Shan.

321
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:31,010
I know you've had a hard time these years.

322
00:16:32,060 --> 00:16:33,470
We can understand that.

323
00:16:35,750 --> 00:16:37,470
But Qi Mo is my husband,

324
00:16:39,810 --> 00:16:41,070
your brother-in-law,

325
00:16:43,270 --> 00:16:45,000
and the person I trust the most.

326
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:47,600
We'll pretend

327
00:16:47,620 --> 00:16:49,580
we didn't hear what you just said.

328
00:16:51,110 --> 00:16:51,900
Let's eat.

329
00:17:04,099 --> 00:17:04,930
I've already got

330
00:17:04,930 --> 00:17:06,060
the answer I wanted.

331
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:16,540
Who is it?

332
00:18:21,910 --> 00:18:22,710
Shan.

333
00:18:22,710 --> 00:18:23,510
Godfather.

334
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:24,710
Shan.

335
00:18:25,820 --> 00:18:27,510
I didn't pick you up that day.

336
00:18:27,510 --> 00:18:28,780
I couldn't sleep

337
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:29,710
for several nights.

338
00:18:29,710 --> 00:18:31,190
Come in. Come in.

339
00:18:32,460 --> 00:18:33,750
Where have you been?

340
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:36,190
Why didn't you call?

341
00:18:36,230 --> 00:18:37,580
I just went for a walk

342
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:38,860
by myself.

343
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:44,820
You've burned the food.

344
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:48,060
I forgot about the fish I was stewing.

345
00:18:48,060 --> 00:18:48,540
Well...

346
00:18:48,540 --> 00:18:49,750
It's okay. Let me do it, Godfather.

347
00:18:49,750 --> 00:18:50,510
Don't...

348
00:19:15,510 --> 00:19:16,300
Come on.

349
00:19:17,500 --> 00:19:18,930
Shan, you really

350
00:19:19,270 --> 00:19:21,030
suffered a lot in there.

351
00:19:23,750 --> 00:19:25,140
Didn't you used to dislike drinking,

352
00:19:25,140 --> 00:19:25,800
Godfather?

353
00:19:27,510 --> 00:19:28,950
I'm at this age now.

354
00:19:28,950 --> 00:19:31,030
I'm retired.

355
00:19:31,100 --> 00:19:32,670
You probably don't know yet.

356
00:19:32,670 --> 00:19:34,230
I got laid off.

357
00:19:34,230 --> 00:19:36,100
It's all thanks to Ying and Mo.

358
00:19:36,100 --> 00:19:38,750
They took pity on me

359
00:19:39,470 --> 00:19:41,100
and got me

360
00:19:41,100 --> 00:19:42,300
a general manager position

361
00:19:42,300 --> 00:19:44,030
at one of the subsidiaries of his company.

362
00:19:44,030 --> 00:19:45,060
There are only a few people there,

363
00:19:45,060 --> 00:19:46,030
and hardly any work.

364
00:19:46,030 --> 00:19:47,580
If I don't drink,

365
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:49,580
life is boring.

366
00:19:49,580 --> 00:19:51,580
Only drinking is a bit interesting.

367
00:19:53,270 --> 00:19:54,270
I'll drink with you.

368
00:19:54,270 --> 00:19:55,860
Come on.

369
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:58,270
Bottoms up.

370
00:19:58,750 --> 00:20:00,030
Do you have any plans

371
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:01,620
now that you're back?

372
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:04,710
Not yet.

373
00:20:05,310 --> 00:20:06,310
I'll wait and see.

374
00:20:09,950 --> 00:20:11,580
D-Don't be so depressed.

375
00:20:12,230 --> 00:20:13,030
It's fine.

376
00:20:13,860 --> 00:20:14,540
Just take some time

377
00:20:14,540 --> 00:20:15,710
to settle back in

378
00:20:16,230 --> 00:20:17,820
and get used to the place.

379
00:20:18,230 --> 00:20:19,470
As for your job,

380
00:20:19,470 --> 00:20:20,670
Ying and Mo

381
00:20:20,670 --> 00:20:22,730
will definitely help you sort it out.

382
00:20:24,230 --> 00:20:25,560
I don't need their help.

383
00:20:27,270 --> 00:20:28,190
And I won't ask them

384
00:20:28,190 --> 00:20:28,950
to help me.

385
00:20:31,950 --> 00:20:33,030
Shan...

386
00:20:33,820 --> 00:20:35,890
listen to my advice.

387
00:20:36,950 --> 00:20:37,950
Listen to me.

388
00:20:38,140 --> 00:20:39,400
Sometimes,

389
00:20:39,430 --> 00:20:41,060
you have to let things go.

390
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:42,720
Godfather,

391
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:45,670
some people might be able
to let these things go,

392
00:20:45,670 --> 00:20:47,190
but I can't.

393
00:20:48,430 --> 00:20:49,750
Ma Yiming was right.

394
00:20:50,060 --> 00:20:51,540
He must have something to do

395
00:20:51,540 --> 00:20:52,670
with my dad's death.

396
00:20:53,270 --> 00:20:54,860
I think about it every minute

397
00:20:54,860 --> 00:20:56,140
of every day.

398
00:20:56,140 --> 00:20:57,620
Have you asked him yourself?

399
00:20:57,620 --> 00:20:58,460
Did you ask him yourself?

400
00:20:58,460 --> 00:20:59,520
Does Ying know?

401
00:21:00,030 --> 00:21:01,340
I went to Qi Mo's house

402
00:21:01,340 --> 00:21:03,140
and confronted him face-to-face.

403
00:21:03,140 --> 00:21:04,190
Qi Mo told me

404
00:21:04,950 --> 00:21:07,080
he never went to the valve pit that day.

405
00:21:10,230 --> 00:21:11,060
Godfather.

406
00:21:11,470 --> 00:21:13,100
I don't want to suspect him, either.

407
00:21:13,100 --> 00:21:14,780
Qi Mo is my brother-in-law.

408
00:21:14,820 --> 00:21:16,100
When my parents had their accident,

409
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:17,470
he helped us so much.

410
00:21:17,670 --> 00:21:19,400
Why would I want to suspect him?

411
00:21:19,470 --> 00:21:21,540
But he said he never
went to the valve pit.

412
00:21:21,540 --> 00:21:22,670
What does that mean?

413
00:21:23,470 --> 00:21:24,860
That means

414
00:21:24,860 --> 00:21:26,030
either he or Ma Yiming

415
00:21:26,030 --> 00:21:27,540
must be lying.

416
00:21:27,910 --> 00:21:29,100
So who is it?

417
00:21:29,670 --> 00:21:30,820
I believe Ma Yiming.

418
00:21:31,380 --> 00:21:33,430
He had no reason to lie.

419
00:21:35,340 --> 00:21:37,740
So there must be something wrong
with Qi Mo.

420
00:21:42,470 --> 00:21:43,270
Well,

421
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:48,010
I didn't want

422
00:21:48,040 --> 00:21:49,800
to say these things.

423
00:21:50,060 --> 00:21:51,110
Look,

424
00:21:51,470 --> 00:21:52,600
with Wan Yang

425
00:21:52,780 --> 00:21:54,190
dead,

426
00:21:54,430 --> 00:21:55,860
who's benefited the most

427
00:21:55,860 --> 00:21:56,720
from his death?

428
00:21:59,910 --> 00:22:01,060
Go on.

429
00:22:01,510 --> 00:22:03,060
After your parents died,

430
00:22:03,670 --> 00:22:05,190
Qi Mo

431
00:22:06,060 --> 00:22:06,950
was always helping you

432
00:22:06,950 --> 00:22:07,750
and Ying,

433
00:22:07,750 --> 00:22:08,910
running around taking care of everything.

434
00:22:08,910 --> 00:22:09,860
Do you think

435
00:22:09,890 --> 00:22:11,230
he was just trying to win Ying over?

436
00:22:11,230 --> 00:22:12,510
Or was it because

437
00:22:12,580 --> 00:22:14,300
your mother—his Master?

438
00:22:14,300 --> 00:22:15,580
Why did he come back

439
00:22:15,580 --> 00:22:17,840
with the investigation team right then?

440
00:22:18,060 --> 00:22:19,860
I'm not saying he planned it all.

441
00:22:19,910 --> 00:22:21,540
At the very least,
he knows the whole story.

442
00:22:21,540 --> 00:22:22,380
He knows everything.

443
00:22:22,380 --> 00:22:24,780
He just wants
to become the plant director.

444
00:22:25,510 --> 00:22:26,640
Just think about it.

445
00:22:49,470 --> 00:22:50,270
Honey, what are you doing?

446
00:22:50,270 --> 00:22:51,950
Did you kill my dad?

447
00:22:52,030 --> 00:22:52,670
It wasn't me!

448
00:22:52,670 --> 00:22:53,510
It wasn't me. It wasn't me.

449
00:22:53,510 --> 00:22:54,190
I didn't do it.

450
00:22:54,190 --> 00:22:56,120
-Did you kill my dad?
-No, I didn't.

451
00:23:31,270 --> 00:23:32,060
Xiaoyun.

452
00:23:34,510 --> 00:23:36,100
What are you doing sitting here?

453
00:23:36,100 --> 00:23:37,500
Why aren't you sleeping?

454
00:23:39,030 --> 00:23:39,950
I can't sleep.

455
00:23:46,510 --> 00:23:48,110
Are you still thinking about

456
00:23:48,750 --> 00:23:50,410
what Shan said during the day?

457
00:23:54,270 --> 00:23:55,600
Let me ask you one thing.

458
00:23:56,860 --> 00:23:57,950
Do you believe me?

459
00:24:06,990 --> 00:24:07,940
Xiaoyun.

460
00:24:08,190 --> 00:24:09,470
I thought about

461
00:24:10,060 --> 00:24:11,520
what Shan said carefully.

462
00:24:12,580 --> 00:24:13,450
Over the years, so many things

463
00:24:13,450 --> 00:24:14,980
have happened at the plant.

464
00:24:15,270 --> 00:24:16,730
Wan Yang was brought down.

465
00:24:17,340 --> 00:24:18,740
An ordinary, dirt-poor,

466
00:24:18,750 --> 00:24:20,580
honest man like me
ended up as plant director.

467
00:24:20,580 --> 00:24:22,380
Many people must be jealous.

468
00:24:22,380 --> 00:24:23,270
Then it's easy

469
00:24:23,620 --> 00:24:24,690
to see why Ma Yiming

470
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:26,180
said those things to Shan.

471
00:24:26,190 --> 00:24:27,990
He was provoked by others to suspect me.

472
00:24:27,990 --> 00:24:29,250
I can understand that.

473
00:24:29,670 --> 00:24:30,530
But Xiaoyun...

474
00:24:36,950 --> 00:24:38,750
You are the closest person to me.

475
00:24:38,820 --> 00:24:39,680
Don't you know

476
00:24:39,710 --> 00:24:41,040
what kind of person I am?

477
00:24:44,310 --> 00:24:45,980
Don't you believe me, either?

478
00:24:50,470 --> 00:24:51,870
You're overthinking it.

479
00:24:53,140 --> 00:24:54,300
I was just wondering

480
00:24:56,620 --> 00:24:58,120
how Shan and I ended up

481
00:24:58,150 --> 00:24:59,340
like this.

482
00:25:05,380 --> 00:25:07,710
I've been very happy these past few years.

483
00:25:09,860 --> 00:25:11,920
Even though you're so busy with work,

484
00:25:12,510 --> 00:25:13,860
you never neglect me

485
00:25:14,300 --> 00:25:15,620
or this family.

486
00:25:16,910 --> 00:25:19,100
You always put me first.

487
00:25:21,100 --> 00:25:22,780
How could I not believe you?

488
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:29,600
I'm glad you say that.

489
00:25:31,030 --> 00:25:34,100
It doesn't matter
if anyone else misunderstands me, then.

490
00:25:34,100 --> 00:25:35,360
I work hard

491
00:25:37,100 --> 00:25:38,630
just to give you a good life.

492
00:25:40,270 --> 00:25:42,600
Thank you for everything you've given me.

493
00:25:47,990 --> 00:25:49,100
Thank you

494
00:25:50,100 --> 00:25:51,630
for always being by my side.

495
00:26:27,550 --> 00:26:32,940
[Wugang New Pipeline
Engineering Technology Co., Ltd.]

496
00:26:47,140 --> 00:26:47,750
Check.

497
00:26:55,430 --> 00:26:56,620
There it is.

498
00:26:56,620 --> 00:26:57,540
Go on.

499
00:26:59,060 --> 00:26:59,900
How's that?

500
00:27:00,540 --> 00:27:01,340
Godfather.

501
00:27:04,130 --> 00:27:05,820
Shan, you're here.

502
00:27:06,620 --> 00:27:07,430
Alright.

503
00:27:07,430 --> 00:27:08,510
Let's stop playing.

504
00:27:08,510 --> 00:27:09,270
My godson is here.

505
00:27:09,270 --> 00:27:10,100
Okay, okay.

506
00:27:10,100 --> 00:27:10,580
Let's play another day.

507
00:27:10,580 --> 00:27:11,100
Let's play another day.

508
00:27:11,100 --> 00:27:11,910
Okay.

509
00:27:12,270 --> 00:27:13,510
I'm pretty good, right?

510
00:27:13,510 --> 00:27:15,060
He's from the company next door.

511
00:27:15,060 --> 00:27:16,520
It's fine. Come, sit down.

512
00:27:23,190 --> 00:27:23,990
You're dead.

513
00:27:26,190 --> 00:27:27,740
Dead. That's right, dead.

514
00:27:28,230 --> 00:27:29,030
Playing Chinese chess

515
00:27:29,030 --> 00:27:30,780
is just like life.

516
00:27:30,990 --> 00:27:33,230
You can be alive
and still be dead inside.

517
00:27:33,230 --> 00:27:34,030
Well,

518
00:27:34,710 --> 00:27:37,170
Godfather, you are a veteran
of the company,

519
00:27:37,820 --> 00:27:38,990
but Qi Mo arranged

520
00:27:38,990 --> 00:27:40,120
such a place for you.

521
00:27:40,380 --> 00:27:41,950
Well, this is life.

522
00:27:44,060 --> 00:27:45,540
After our chat that day,

523
00:27:46,190 --> 00:27:46,980
I went back

524
00:27:47,010 --> 00:27:48,810
and thought about it carefully.

525
00:27:49,100 --> 00:27:50,540
The more I think about it,

526
00:27:51,670 --> 00:27:52,380
the more I feel I can't

527
00:27:52,380 --> 00:27:53,640
just sit and wait here.

528
00:27:54,060 --> 00:27:55,430
So I have an idea

529
00:27:55,780 --> 00:27:57,190
to discuss with you.

530
00:27:57,430 --> 00:27:58,270
Tell me.

531
00:27:58,430 --> 00:27:59,830
Let me join your company,

532
00:28:00,510 --> 00:28:01,750
and we'll team up

533
00:28:02,030 --> 00:28:03,190
to take down Qi Mo.

534
00:28:04,710 --> 00:28:05,750
J-Just the two of us?

535
00:28:05,750 --> 00:28:07,030
There are only two people in this company.

536
00:28:07,030 --> 00:28:08,060
How can you do it?

537
00:28:08,270 --> 00:28:09,340
We don't have the strength

538
00:28:09,340 --> 00:28:10,230
to beat him.

539
00:28:10,230 --> 00:28:10,950
Godfather.

540
00:28:11,300 --> 00:28:12,780
So what if we don't have anyone?

541
00:28:12,780 --> 00:28:14,040
We can recruit people.

542
00:28:14,270 --> 00:28:14,990
Just get me

543
00:28:14,990 --> 00:28:16,190
into the company,

544
00:28:16,340 --> 00:28:17,780
and I'll go to Qi Mo

545
00:28:17,780 --> 00:28:19,030
and demand resources,

546
00:28:19,030 --> 00:28:20,430
projects, and money.

547
00:28:20,430 --> 00:28:21,960
There's nothing I can't do.

548
00:28:23,540 --> 00:28:25,220
Not bad.

549
00:28:25,300 --> 00:28:25,780
Right.

550
00:28:25,780 --> 00:28:26,820
I have to let you join the company first.

551
00:28:26,820 --> 00:28:27,470
I'll handle this

552
00:28:27,470 --> 00:28:28,580
right now.

553
00:28:29,300 --> 00:28:30,060
I'll make a call

554
00:28:30,060 --> 00:28:31,510
and arrange it.

555
00:28:42,580 --> 00:28:43,380
Manager Qi.

556
00:28:44,750 --> 00:28:46,030
I have something

557
00:28:46,030 --> 00:28:46,950
to report

558
00:28:46,970 --> 00:28:48,080
to you.

559
00:28:48,710 --> 00:28:49,820
Well, Shan

560
00:28:49,820 --> 00:28:51,480
wants to join the subsidiary.

561
00:28:52,860 --> 00:28:53,620
No.

562
00:28:55,620 --> 00:28:57,060
Are you still angry?

563
00:28:57,140 --> 00:28:58,710
Other things might be forgivable,

564
00:28:58,710 --> 00:29:00,340
but we can't keep indulging him

565
00:29:00,340 --> 00:29:01,470
when it comes to matters

566
00:29:01,470 --> 00:29:02,300
of principle.

567
00:29:03,620 --> 00:29:04,190
He has no respect

568
00:29:04,190 --> 00:29:05,100
for me as his older sister

569
00:29:05,100 --> 00:29:06,960
or for you as his brother-in-law.

570
00:29:07,100 --> 00:29:08,620
He just got out of prison.

571
00:29:08,990 --> 00:29:09,850
Think about it.

572
00:29:09,990 --> 00:29:11,340
He spent three years in there.

573
00:29:11,340 --> 00:29:13,100
Just think about
what he must've been through.

574
00:29:13,100 --> 00:29:13,950
Don't worry.

575
00:29:14,270 --> 00:29:15,800
No matter what he says to me,

576
00:29:15,860 --> 00:29:16,750
I won't take it to heart,

577
00:29:16,750 --> 00:29:17,620
okay?

578
00:29:17,950 --> 00:29:19,190
That's exactly why

579
00:29:19,190 --> 00:29:20,910
we can't let him join the company.

580
00:29:20,910 --> 00:29:22,300
He's so unpredictable.

581
00:29:23,140 --> 00:29:24,060
Who knows how much trouble

582
00:29:24,060 --> 00:29:25,190
he will cause us.

583
00:29:25,190 --> 00:29:26,140
Let me ask you.

584
00:29:26,430 --> 00:29:27,490
He's out of prison.

585
00:29:27,670 --> 00:29:29,470
Doesn't he need to find something to do?

586
00:29:29,470 --> 00:29:30,450
Isn't Godfather

587
00:29:30,470 --> 00:29:31,990
helping to keep an eye on him?

588
00:29:31,990 --> 00:29:33,140
I think

589
00:29:33,270 --> 00:29:35,270
joining the subsidiary is the safest.

590
00:29:35,270 --> 00:29:37,190
After all, we know him well.

591
00:29:37,950 --> 00:29:38,710
He dared to pin

592
00:29:38,710 --> 00:29:39,630
such a big thing

593
00:29:39,660 --> 00:29:40,910
on you that day.

594
00:29:43,820 --> 00:29:45,230
If he really joins the company,

595
00:29:45,230 --> 00:29:46,820
who knows what he might do.

596
00:29:49,100 --> 00:29:50,840
The company is about to bid,

597
00:29:51,540 --> 00:29:53,270
so there can't be any mistakes.

598
00:29:54,540 --> 00:29:55,620
You ask him out.

599
00:29:56,540 --> 00:29:57,670
I want to talk to him.

600
00:30:00,950 --> 00:30:02,540
Okay, I'll try.

601
00:30:03,620 --> 00:30:06,080
Turn around.
I'll keep giving you a massage.

602
00:30:41,230 --> 00:30:42,030
Godfather,

603
00:30:42,380 --> 00:30:44,230
why do you keep your head down?

604
00:30:50,030 --> 00:30:51,430
I just can't bear to look.

605
00:30:55,060 --> 00:30:57,020
Because I was so close

606
00:30:57,050 --> 00:30:58,300
to your parents.

607
00:31:00,190 --> 00:31:01,190
Whenever I look up

608
00:31:01,750 --> 00:31:03,030
and see those two wonderful people

609
00:31:03,030 --> 00:31:04,630
frozen in time in this photo,

610
00:31:05,430 --> 00:31:06,230
it hurts.

611
00:31:16,670 --> 00:31:19,070
I still remember
when Dad just passed away.

612
00:31:20,710 --> 00:31:21,950
He left so suddenly

613
00:31:22,380 --> 00:31:23,620
that we didn't even have a decent photo

614
00:31:23,620 --> 00:31:24,430
of him.

615
00:31:25,340 --> 00:31:26,750
So we searched

616
00:31:27,140 --> 00:31:29,600
and found this photo
of Mom and Dad together.

617
00:31:30,670 --> 00:31:31,520
We thought

618
00:31:31,540 --> 00:31:33,430
we'd cut the photo in half

619
00:31:34,100 --> 00:31:35,080
and put Dad's half up

620
00:31:35,080 --> 00:31:38,100
as his memorial portraitas.

621
00:31:41,510 --> 00:31:42,750
Unexpectedly, not long after,

622
00:31:42,750 --> 00:31:43,950
Mom also passed away.

623
00:31:44,910 --> 00:31:46,270
Ying and I thought about

624
00:31:46,950 --> 00:31:48,600
gluing the two halves

625
00:31:48,860 --> 00:31:50,140
back together.

626
00:31:51,580 --> 00:31:54,340
Then it was whole again.

627
00:31:56,030 --> 00:31:57,230
This way, it was as if

628
00:31:59,300 --> 00:32:01,560
Mom and Dad were finally together again.

629
00:32:01,670 --> 00:32:02,670
Shan,

630
00:32:02,860 --> 00:32:04,390
let's talk about business.

631
00:32:04,820 --> 00:32:06,220
Well, there's a problem.

632
00:32:07,380 --> 00:32:09,350
Your joining the subsidiary

633
00:32:09,470 --> 00:32:11,910
was pretty much a done deal.

634
00:32:12,430 --> 00:32:14,320
But when it came to your brother-in-law,

635
00:32:14,320 --> 00:32:15,040
he just...

636
00:32:15,190 --> 00:32:16,030
disagreed.

637
00:32:17,680 --> 00:32:19,130
Qi Mo disagreed?

638
00:32:19,510 --> 00:32:21,370
Right, this is going to be tricky.

639
00:32:25,910 --> 00:32:27,750
It's fine. The more he disagrees,

640
00:32:27,750 --> 00:32:28,710
the more it shows

641
00:32:28,990 --> 00:32:30,300
he's guilty

642
00:32:30,990 --> 00:32:32,460
and nervous about this.

643
00:32:35,430 --> 00:32:36,430
It's fine, Godfather.

644
00:32:36,430 --> 00:32:37,960
I'll figure something out.

645
00:32:39,030 --> 00:32:39,820
Okay, okay.

646
00:32:51,860 --> 00:32:52,580
Shan.

647
00:32:54,950 --> 00:32:55,670
Manager Qi.

648
00:32:59,270 --> 00:33:00,530
Do you need something?

649
00:33:01,510 --> 00:33:03,650
You know, the other day at home,

650
00:33:03,950 --> 00:33:05,430
things got pretty unpleasant.

651
00:33:05,430 --> 00:33:06,220
Today,

652
00:33:06,240 --> 00:33:07,470
I waited here specifically for you.

653
00:33:07,470 --> 00:33:08,470
Xiaoyun and I want

654
00:33:08,950 --> 00:33:10,000
to treat you

655
00:33:10,140 --> 00:33:11,230
to a meal.

656
00:33:13,430 --> 00:33:14,270
A trap?

657
00:33:16,950 --> 00:33:17,750
Shan.

658
00:33:17,860 --> 00:33:19,590
During those 3 years you were in prison,

659
00:33:19,590 --> 00:33:21,060
Xiaoyun thought about you

660
00:33:21,090 --> 00:33:22,140
all the time.

661
00:33:22,300 --> 00:33:23,950
Whether you believe it or not,

662
00:33:23,950 --> 00:33:24,950
we

663
00:33:25,140 --> 00:33:27,270
have never treated you as an outsider.

664
00:33:27,270 --> 00:33:28,800
Whether you admit it or not,

665
00:33:28,990 --> 00:33:30,820
I will always be your brother-in-law.

666
00:33:30,820 --> 00:33:31,580
This meal

667
00:33:32,230 --> 00:33:33,710
doesn't mean anything else.

668
00:33:33,710 --> 00:33:35,140
I just want to clear up

669
00:33:35,230 --> 00:33:36,710
all the misunderstandings,

670
00:33:36,710 --> 00:33:37,430
okay?

671
00:33:37,580 --> 00:33:39,340
After all, we are family.

672
00:33:40,820 --> 00:33:42,230
I understand what's been

673
00:33:42,670 --> 00:33:43,910
eating at you.

674
00:33:44,100 --> 00:33:44,710
Well,

675
00:33:45,430 --> 00:33:46,580
you believe everything

676
00:33:46,580 --> 00:33:48,300
other people tell you.

677
00:33:48,820 --> 00:33:50,340
But I've explained

678
00:33:50,620 --> 00:33:52,510
everything to you, haven't I?

679
00:33:52,580 --> 00:33:53,540
As for the rest,

680
00:33:54,230 --> 00:33:55,990
we can only leave it to time.

681
00:33:57,190 --> 00:33:58,300
What if

682
00:33:58,470 --> 00:33:59,820
I just don't want to go to this meal?

683
00:33:59,820 --> 00:34:00,730
Well,

684
00:34:01,340 --> 00:34:02,710
why wouldn't you go?

685
00:34:03,270 --> 00:34:04,510
Are you afraid of something?

686
00:34:04,510 --> 00:34:05,090
I know

687
00:34:05,120 --> 00:34:06,910
during those three years in prison,

688
00:34:06,910 --> 00:34:08,139
you took a hit.

689
00:34:08,139 --> 00:34:08,909
But you

690
00:34:09,060 --> 00:34:10,340
have to move on.

691
00:34:10,370 --> 00:34:11,699
You have to face your new life.

692
00:34:11,699 --> 00:34:12,260
No.

693
00:34:12,580 --> 00:34:13,429
Manager Qi,

694
00:34:14,389 --> 00:34:16,100
I have already moved on.

695
00:34:16,790 --> 00:34:18,989
And I shouldn't be the one who's afraid.

696
00:34:20,659 --> 00:34:22,170
It's just a meal, right?

697
00:34:22,540 --> 00:34:23,469
I'll go with you.

698
00:34:23,870 --> 00:34:24,350
Let's go.

699
00:34:24,350 --> 00:34:24,949
Let's go.

700
00:34:53,350 --> 00:34:54,060
Xiaoyun.

701
00:34:54,659 --> 00:34:56,920
You're here. We've been waiting for you.

702
00:34:57,350 --> 00:34:58,990
Please serve the food.

703
00:35:02,390 --> 00:35:03,730
Here, give it to me.

704
00:35:06,430 --> 00:35:08,430
Today, let's not

705
00:35:08,470 --> 00:35:09,330
let groundless things

706
00:35:09,330 --> 00:35:10,260
make us unhappy.

707
00:35:10,310 --> 00:35:11,530
And you two shouldn't let this

708
00:35:11,530 --> 00:35:12,830
hurt your relationship as siblings,

709
00:35:12,830 --> 00:35:13,430
right?

710
00:35:13,430 --> 00:35:13,950
Hello.

711
00:35:15,430 --> 00:35:17,060
It's no use telling me.

712
00:35:17,910 --> 00:35:19,540
A degree from a top university

713
00:35:19,540 --> 00:35:20,990
won't protect you.

714
00:35:21,740 --> 00:35:23,220
There's no room for negotiation.

715
00:35:23,220 --> 00:35:24,480
You made such a rookie mistake.

716
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:26,740
How do you expect the company to keep you?

717
00:35:27,060 --> 00:35:29,120
The company doesn't pay dead weight.

718
00:35:35,350 --> 00:35:36,280
Well...

719
00:35:36,390 --> 00:35:37,180
Here.

720
00:35:37,870 --> 00:35:39,100
I've cut it for you.

721
00:35:39,220 --> 00:35:40,500
You eat this.

722
00:35:40,660 --> 00:35:41,260
Shan,

723
00:35:41,990 --> 00:35:42,720
you eat, too.

724
00:35:48,790 --> 00:35:50,990
Three years ago, you publicly declared

725
00:35:51,260 --> 00:35:52,370
that Chen Fu and Zhang Wenying

726
00:35:52,370 --> 00:35:53,630
had killed my parents,

727
00:35:54,220 --> 00:35:57,220
shattering the life I'd spent
over 20 years building.

728
00:35:57,950 --> 00:35:58,790
I forgave you

729
00:35:58,790 --> 00:36:00,220
because I believed you

730
00:36:00,470 --> 00:36:02,180
would rather sacrifice yourself

731
00:36:02,180 --> 00:36:03,470
to make me happy.

732
00:36:04,990 --> 00:36:06,990
You attempted suicide
3 times in prison

733
00:36:06,990 --> 00:36:08,350
just to see me.

734
00:36:09,950 --> 00:36:11,280
But when we finally met,

735
00:36:11,620 --> 00:36:13,390
you only told me to be careful.

736
00:36:15,220 --> 00:36:17,260
I was three months pregnant then,

737
00:36:17,790 --> 00:36:19,100
constantly on edge.

738
00:36:19,100 --> 00:36:20,560
I ended up losing the baby.

739
00:36:22,390 --> 00:36:23,660
After you got out of prison,
you immediately came

740
00:36:23,660 --> 00:36:24,970
and accused my husband, Qi Mo,

741
00:36:24,970 --> 00:36:26,470
of being the murderer who killed Chen Fu.

742
00:36:26,470 --> 00:36:27,470
Tell me,

743
00:36:28,260 --> 00:36:29,950
why did you kill my dad?

744
00:36:30,030 --> 00:36:31,180
Where is the evidence?

745
00:36:31,180 --> 00:36:33,100
I'm asking you, where is the evidence?

746
00:36:33,100 --> 00:36:34,100
Chen Shan,

747
00:36:34,410 --> 00:36:36,180
claiming you were doing it
for my own good,

748
00:36:36,180 --> 00:36:38,470
you've torn my life apart
time and time again.

749
00:36:38,470 --> 00:36:39,540
Do you have any idea

750
00:36:39,540 --> 00:36:40,910
how hard it was for me to put myself

751
00:36:40,910 --> 00:36:41,830
back together?

752
00:36:42,830 --> 00:36:44,660
Chen Shan, listen to me carefully.

753
00:36:44,660 --> 00:36:45,960
From now on,

754
00:36:46,100 --> 00:36:47,540
I have absolutely nothing to do with you

755
00:36:47,540 --> 00:36:49,060
or your Chen family.

756
00:36:50,990 --> 00:36:53,120
You can say whatever you want about me,

757
00:36:53,390 --> 00:36:55,920
but you can't talk about
Mom and Dad like that.

758
00:36:55,950 --> 00:36:58,060
I didn't expect you to be so cold-blooded.

759
00:36:58,060 --> 00:36:59,620
I don't have a sister like you.

760
00:36:59,620 --> 00:37:00,870
If you don't like the food, don't eat it.

761
00:37:00,870 --> 00:37:02,490
W-What are you doing?

762
00:37:02,910 --> 00:37:04,330
Wipe it, wipe it, wipe it.

763
00:37:04,510 --> 00:37:05,570
What are you doing?

764
00:37:05,910 --> 00:37:06,430
Come on, come on.

765
00:37:06,430 --> 00:37:07,560
Well, well, just...

766
00:37:10,180 --> 00:37:11,430
This is to pay for your clothes.

767
00:37:11,430 --> 00:37:13,830
It's enough for you
to buy several outfits.

768
00:37:17,930 --> 00:37:18,240
[File Folder]

769
00:37:18,790 --> 00:37:20,000
This is your father Chen Fu's

770
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:20,660
pension.

771
00:37:20,870 --> 00:37:21,700
It was 100,000 yuan,

772
00:37:21,700 --> 00:37:22,830
plus three years of interest,

773
00:37:22,830 --> 00:37:25,990
bringing the total to 122,328 yuan.

774
00:37:26,030 --> 00:37:27,190
You can take this money

775
00:37:27,190 --> 00:37:29,320
and go south to do some small business.

776
00:37:29,830 --> 00:37:31,260
Sell socks wholesale,

777
00:37:31,620 --> 00:37:33,620
or shoe insoles, whatever you like.

778
00:37:34,510 --> 00:37:36,050
Calm down.

779
00:37:38,310 --> 00:37:39,640
Got a problem with that?

780
00:37:40,910 --> 00:37:42,240
Chen Shan, let me tell you,

781
00:37:42,240 --> 00:37:44,170
there is no place for you in Wugang.

782
00:37:44,990 --> 00:37:46,430
This is reality.

783
00:37:48,030 --> 00:37:48,990
If I were you,

784
00:37:49,870 --> 00:37:51,710
I would take the money and leave.

785
00:37:52,790 --> 00:37:54,320
Let me make one thing clear:

786
00:37:55,430 --> 00:37:57,620
This money is rightfully mine.

787
00:37:58,260 --> 00:37:59,310
I don't need you here

788
00:37:59,310 --> 00:38:00,440
telling me what to do

789
00:38:07,640 --> 00:38:08,800
You... you two...

790
00:38:13,140 --> 00:38:14,930
I'll pay the bill.

791
00:38:14,990 --> 00:38:17,350
S-Sorry.

792
00:38:17,430 --> 00:38:19,060
Xiaoyun, Xiaoyun.

793
00:38:41,660 --> 00:38:42,470
Xiaoyun.

794
00:38:43,430 --> 00:38:45,630
I really have to say a word for Chen Shan.

795
00:38:46,060 --> 00:38:46,870
You didn't

796
00:38:47,220 --> 00:38:48,750
have to treat him like that.

797
00:38:50,140 --> 00:38:51,670
Stop trying to persuade me.

798
00:38:52,430 --> 00:38:54,330
You know him.

799
00:38:54,990 --> 00:38:56,050
He's been like this

800
00:38:56,350 --> 00:38:57,260
for a long time,

801
00:38:57,260 --> 00:38:58,140
hasn't he?

802
00:38:58,140 --> 00:38:58,890
He gets worked up

803
00:38:58,890 --> 00:39:00,650
whenever something happens.

804
00:39:01,260 --> 00:39:02,520
Why don't you calm down

805
00:39:02,950 --> 00:39:04,470
and let him calm down, too, okay?

806
00:39:04,470 --> 00:39:05,260
Qi Mo.

807
00:39:06,180 --> 00:39:07,410
You could let go of what he said

808
00:39:07,410 --> 00:39:08,090
when he showed up

809
00:39:08,090 --> 00:39:08,990
at our house that day.

810
00:39:08,990 --> 00:39:10,100
But what about today?

811
00:39:10,100 --> 00:39:11,630
What was with his attitude?

812
00:39:11,950 --> 00:39:12,960
He has changed.

813
00:39:12,980 --> 00:39:13,800
He is no longer the innocent

814
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:15,310
and kind Chen Shan.

815
00:39:17,580 --> 00:39:19,580
I don't want to fight
with you because of him.

816
00:39:19,580 --> 00:39:20,910
Anyway, remember this.

817
00:39:21,220 --> 00:39:23,020
From now on, he is him, and I am me.

818
00:39:23,310 --> 00:39:25,240
Don't bring him up to me ever again.

819
00:39:28,660 --> 00:39:29,470
Okay.

820
00:39:30,140 --> 00:39:31,230
Calm down first.

821
00:39:31,250 --> 00:39:32,250
Calm down.

822
00:39:42,090 --> 00:39:42,880
What?

823
00:39:47,430 --> 00:39:48,440
Ying said that?

824
00:39:49,910 --> 00:39:52,770
She wants you to take the money
and get out of Wugang?

825
00:39:55,810 --> 00:39:57,210
I-I don't believe it.

826
00:39:57,870 --> 00:39:58,850
Do you know why?

827
00:39:58,870 --> 00:39:59,190
Because I

828
00:39:59,190 --> 00:40:00,510
know her too well.

829
00:40:00,540 --> 00:40:01,620
I watched her grow up.

830
00:40:01,620 --> 00:40:02,400
She's not the kind of

831
00:40:02,400 --> 00:40:03,460
heartless person.

832
00:40:03,550 --> 00:40:04,660
She wouldn't say something like that

833
00:40:04,660 --> 00:40:05,700
unless Qi Mo had been putting ideas

834
00:40:05,700 --> 00:40:06,740
in her head.

835
00:40:07,510 --> 00:40:08,340
Qi Mo.

836
00:40:10,300 --> 00:40:11,660
Qi Mo is

837
00:40:12,110 --> 00:40:13,990
still pretending to be a good guy here,

838
00:40:13,990 --> 00:40:15,340
trying to make peace

839
00:40:15,340 --> 00:40:16,110
between me and Ying every day.

840
00:40:16,110 --> 00:40:17,620
He's just two-faced.

841
00:40:17,990 --> 00:40:18,820
I shouldn't have said

842
00:40:18,820 --> 00:40:20,030
such harsh words,

843
00:40:20,220 --> 00:40:21,430
but he is really

844
00:40:21,780 --> 00:40:22,780
too infuriating.

845
00:40:22,780 --> 00:40:24,580
Isn't this forcing you to leave?

846
00:40:25,180 --> 00:40:26,140
Shan, let me tell you,

847
00:40:26,140 --> 00:40:27,340
the more he acts like this,

848
00:40:27,340 --> 00:40:28,390
the more I'm convinced that Ma Yiming

849
00:40:28,390 --> 00:40:29,650
was telling the truth.

850
00:40:30,390 --> 00:40:32,430
You think so, too, Godfather?

851
00:40:33,070 --> 00:40:34,530
Then I won't wait anymore.

852
00:40:34,620 --> 00:40:35,950
I'll go find him directly.

853
00:40:35,950 --> 00:40:37,220
I'll ask him face to face.

854
00:40:37,220 --> 00:40:38,340
I'll take him on myself.

855
00:40:38,340 --> 00:40:39,510
If it comes to it, we'll go down together.

856
00:40:39,510 --> 00:40:40,820
No, you can't be so impulsive.

857
00:40:40,820 --> 00:40:42,880
I will definitely help you with this.

858
00:40:43,390 --> 00:40:43,990
Don't worry.

859
00:40:43,990 --> 00:40:45,070
Let me think about it.

860
00:40:45,070 --> 00:40:46,270
Let me think about it.

861
00:40:46,700 --> 00:40:47,510
That guy,

862
00:40:48,140 --> 00:40:48,910
Qi Mo,

863
00:40:48,910 --> 00:40:49,950
what he cares about most now

864
00:40:49,950 --> 00:40:51,260
is his company.

865
00:40:51,510 --> 00:40:52,430
Isn't he getting ready

866
00:40:52,430 --> 00:40:53,690
to bid on that project?

867
00:40:53,950 --> 00:40:55,140
He's preparing for the bidding.

868
00:40:55,140 --> 00:40:55,910
If we want to deal with him,

869
00:40:55,910 --> 00:40:57,110
we have to start with his company

870
00:40:57,110 --> 00:40:58,820
and the project he's doing.

871
00:40:59,110 --> 00:41:00,510
Godfather, you mean...

872
00:41:00,510 --> 00:41:00,990
Shan,

873
00:41:00,990 --> 00:41:02,110
